ion":"Fiscal year end of most recent annual statement used."},"retrieved_at":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required — send a complete v2 PaymentPayload in PAYMENT-SIGNATURE using the current challenge. Legacy X-PAYMENT accepts the same v2 envelope and verification.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer","example":2},"error":{"type":"string"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"payment_negotiation":{"type":"object","description":"Optional stall-payment-negotiation/v1 extension; canonical x402 fields remain unchanged."}},"required":["x402Version","accepts"]}}}}}}},"/cap/equity-sentiment":{"get":{"operationId":"equity-sentiment","summary":"Stock market Fear & Greed composite (equity sentiment). Four signals: VIX vs 90-day percentile, SPY vs 200-day moving average, US high-yield credit spread vs 90-day range (FRED BAMLH0A0HYM2), SPY RSI-14. Returns composite score 0–100 (0=extreme greed, 100=extreme fear) with regime label and per-signal breakdown. Distinct from market-sentiment (crypto). Use before sizing positions, adjusting portfolio risk, or routing capital. Free sources, no API keys.","tags":["capabilities"],"security":[{"x402Payment":[]},{"bearerToken":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"registry":"https://the-stall.intuitek.ai/v1/payment-methods","negotiation":"https://the-stall.intuitek.ai/v1/payment-negotiations","protocols":[{"x402":{"method_id":"base-usdc-x402","network":"eip155:8453","scheme":"exact","currency":"USDC","paymentHeader":"PAYMENT-SIGNATURE","challengeHeader":"PAYMENT-REQUIRED","receiptHeader":"PAYMENT-RESPONSE","payloadEncoding":"base64-json","x402Version":2,"instructions":"Send the complete v2 PaymentPayload using the current challenge. Legacy X-PAYMENT is accepted only for a v2 envelope and receives the same verification and settlement checks. Paid output is returned only after successful settlement."}},{"mpp":{"method_id":"stripe-mpp-spt","network":"