NATURE using the current challenge. Legacy X-PAYMENT accepts the same v2 envelope and verification.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer","example":2},"error":{"type":"string"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"payment_negotiation":{"type":"object","description":"Optional stall-payment-negotiation/v1 extension; canonical x402 fields remain unchanged."}},"required":["x402Version","accepts"]}}}}}}},"/cap/tx-intel":{"get":{"operationId":"tx-intel","summary":"Decode and explain any EVM transaction — in one x402 payment. Returns: transaction status, type (ETH transfer / ERC20 transfer / swap / approval / contract call), human-readable summary, token transfers parsed from logs, gas cost, block context, and explorer URL. Collapses the observed tx-explainer + onesource/block agent seam (18 wallets, 8-day persistence). Supports Base (default), Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, Avalanche, BSC. Free upstream: DRPC + public RPC nodes. $0.031/call.","tags":["capabilities"],"security":[{"x402Payment":[]},{"bearerToken":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"registry":"https://the-stall.intuitek.ai/v1/payment-methods","negotiation":"https://the-stall.intuitek.ai/v1/payment-negotiations","protocols":[{"x402":{"method_id":"base-usdc-x402","network":"eip155:8453","scheme":"exact","currency":"USDC","paymentHeader":"PAYMENT-SIGNATURE","challengeHeader":"PAYMENT-REQUIRED","receiptHeader":"PAYMENT-RESPONSE","payloadEncoding":"base64-json","x402Version":2,"instructions":"Send the complete v2 PaymentPayload using the current challenge. Legacy X-PAYMENT is accepted only for a v2 envelope and receives the same verification and settlement checks. Paid output is returned only after successful settlement."}},{"mpp":{"method_id":"stripe-mpp-spt","network":"stripe","scheme":"charge","currency":"USD","method":"stripe","intent":"charge"}},{"internal-credit":{"method_id":"stall-prepaid-bearer","network":"STALL ledger","schem